        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success In Progress is a precision platformer game focused on improving, in which failure helps you get closer to the goal each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fail, you splash, creating tomato sauce that will help you go higher every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sauce splashing, the world reacts to you falling by splashing sauce everywhere</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall jumping! If you end up with sauce on a wall or the side of a platform, you can jump off of it!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 full-length levels (And maybe a bit more somewhere hidden?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One very handsome Tomato (Or it is really &quot;one&quot;?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 special modifiers to re-play the levels in a completely different way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Drawn graphics, for every single bit of a level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic auto-save, leave and comeback at any time, your level progress will be saved</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every salad?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success In Progress is a precision platformer game focused on improving, in which failure helps you get closer to the goal each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fail, you splash, creating tomato sauce that will help you go higher every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sauce splashing, the world reacts to you falling by splashing sauce everywhere</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall jumping! If you end up with sauce on a wall or the side of a platform, you can jump off of it!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 full-length levels (And maybe a bit more somewhere hidden?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One very handsome Tomato (Or it is really &quot;one&quot;?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 special modifiers to re-play the levels in a completely different way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Drawn graphics, for every single bit of a level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic auto-save, leave and comeback at any time, your level progress will be saved</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every salad?</p>",
        "short_description": "Become a brave tomato soldier on a quest to invade salads! In this challenging precision platformer, falling is part of the journey. Each splash you make clears your path to victory. Remember: failure is just Success In Progress!",
